+  - 'the engine loads the installed pack: a live intercept/bridge probe returns the
+    pack rule id (pack-<name>-*) with the pack installed, and does not without it'
+  - 'id-collision contract: a pack rule whose id collides with an engine builtin id,
+    or with an already-installed pack, is REFUSED (non-zero exit, no file written)'
+  - schema-invalid pack is refused at install time (non-zero exit, nothing written);
